<title>USA: Aztar Indiana casino Feb revs up 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Aztar Indiana casino Feb revs up 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aztar Corp said on Tuesday that its riverboat casino in Evansville, Ind., had revenues of $8.5 million in February, up 11 percent from $7.9 million for the same month in 1996.</p>
<p>Per-day revenue at Casino Aztar Evansville averaged $302,249 in February, up from an average of $252,079 in January, it said.</p>
</text>
